<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:144%;">Interpretable Physics Reasoning and Performance Taxonomy in Vision-Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Pranav Pawar
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
