<span id="id1" class="ltx_inline-block fa fa-github" aria-hidden="true">
</span><a href="https://github.com/prnvpwr2612/Interpretable-Physics-Reasoning-and-Performance-Taxonomy-in-Vision-Language-Models" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">GitHub Repository</a>
